<div class="r-site" data-r107-page data-family="studio-intro" data-modules="1,2,3,4,5,6"><section class="r-studio-intro"><div><p class="r-eyebrow">AI Charm Studio · In preparation</p><h1>Let the next charm begin with your idea.</h1><p>Describe an idea, upload one sketch or reference photo you have permission to use, or use both.</p><div class="r-actions"><a class="r-button" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/co-create' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Explore the examples<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a><a class="r-button r-button--line" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/studio-workspace' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Try the local workspace<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></div></div><figure><img src="{{ 'suiji-studio-hero.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Existing SUIJI concept examples" width="1200" height="1400" loading="eager" decoding="async" class="" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Existing studies, not live AI results.</figcaption></figure></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>An idea, in a form you can discuss</h2></div><p>Compare directions, then see their proportions on different bases.</p><div class="r-grid r-grid--studies"><article class="r-study"><a href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/study-aurora' | replace: '//', '/' }}"><img src="{{ 'suiji-aurora-ring-packshot.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Aurora" width="1200" height="1400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=""><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI study · Concept</p><h3>Aurora</h3><p>A rounded green form framed by an open, sculptural line.</p></a></article><article class="r-study"><a href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/study-pink-orbit' | replace: '//', '/' }}"><img src="{{ 'suiji-studio-pink-earrings.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Pink Orbit" width="1200" height="1400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=""><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI study · Concept</p><h3>Pink Orbit</h3><p>Soft pink volumes meet a textured metal outline.</p></a></article><article class="r-study"><a href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/study-gate' | replace: '//', '/' }}"><img src="{{ 'suiji-studio-gate-ring.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Gate" width="1200" height="1400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=""><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI study · Concept</p><h3>Gate</h3><p>An open rectangular shape, held in a simple continuous line.</p></a></article><article class="r-study"><a href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/study-triangle' | replace: '//', '/' }}"><img src="{{ 'suiji-studio-triangle-earrings.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Line / Triangle" width="1200" height="1400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=""><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI study · Concept</p><h3>Line / Triangle</h3><p>A graphic outline with room for light and movement.</p></a></article></div></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>From a concept to a wearable piece</h2></div><p>Concepts and 3D previews help discuss appearance. Feasibility, engineering, prototypes and production are subsequent steps, arranged after the version, materials and price are confirmed.</p><ol class="r-steps"><li><span>01</span><h3>Explore</h3></li><li><span>02</span><h3>Review the structure</h3></li><li><span>03</span><h3>Agree the version</h3></li><li><span>04</span><h3>Make & check</h3></li></ol></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Prefer to speak to a person?</h2></div><p>You can email us about a different material, a design or a way of wearing a piece. A paid membership is not required for a custom enquiry.</p><a class="r-link" href="mailto:contact@suijijewelry.com">contact@suijijewelry.com<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></section></div>
